@Geo_HostAddress = http://localhost:4002

### Name the area around a coordinate (anonymous). Coordinates are rounded to 3 decimals server-side.
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/area?latitude=-26.088&longitude=28.228
Accept: application/json

### Out of range, expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/area?latitude=95&longitude=28.228
Accept: application/json

### Nearby places of the configured Geo:NearbyPlaceKinds in a viewport (anonymous). ~5 km, 4 tiles.
### With no kinds configured the search is off and answers an empty, complete result.
### An empty `places` with `incomplete: false` means the area has none; 503 means nothing was cached
### and the provider was unavailable — retry. `address` and `phone` are null wherever it holds none.
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.15&west=28.18&north=-26.06&east=28.29
Accept: application/json

### Exactly at the 24-tile cap (4 x 6 tiles, ~25 km x 50 km), expect 200.
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.35&west=28.10&north=-25.90&east=28.35
Accept: application/json

### One tile column wider, 30 tiles — expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.35&west=28.10&north=-25.90&east=28.45
Accept: application/json

### Wildly over the cap (957 tiles), expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-27.5&west=27.0&north=-25.0&east=29.5
Accept: application/json

### Inverted bounding box (south >= north), expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.06&west=28.18&north=-26.15&east=28.29
Accept: application/json

### Antimeridian crossing (west >= east), expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.15&west=179.9&north=-26.06&east=-179.9
Accept: application/json

### Longitude out of range, expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/nearby-places?south=-26.15&west=-200&north=-26.06&east=28.29
Accept: application/json

### Search areas for the manual picker (anonymous)
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/areas?search=Kempton%20Park&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Missing search text, expect 400
GET {{Geo_HostAddress}}/api/geo/areas
Accept: application/json
